• Noisy Audio is harder to detect, as illustrated in Figure 10 (b) for instance. We
characterize it by first assessing that we are not in either a silence or background noise
case, and then testing whether the standard deviation of the tokens’ entropy across
the audio codebooks is above a certain threshold ηnoise = 0.6.

